Let me fix: 
```
int nameLenByte = b3.get() & 0xff;
int huffman = nameLenByte & 0x80;
// rewind: push back
b3.position(b3.position()-1);
int nameLen = Hpack.decodeInteger(b3, 7);
```
Simpler: use duplicate. Let me just do: int nameLenByte = b3.get( b3.position() ) & 0xff; then nameLen = decodeInteger.

